OL,3,GNEWSANHS Western Isles prescribing
OL,4,Aweight loss drugs at triple the rate of
OL,5,Aother health boards
OL,6,
OL,7,FPatients in the Western Isles are being
OL,8,Fprescribed drugs used for weight loss
OL,9,Fand diabetes at almost three times the
OL,10,Frate of any other health board in
OL,11,FScotland.
OL,13,FA new report from the Association of
OL,14,Fthe British Pharmaceutical Industry
OL,15,F(ABPI) found "significant variation"
OL,16,Fbetween Scotland's health boards
OL,17,Fprescribing new medicines, including
OL,18,Fdrugs for heart attacks and strokes.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
