OL,3,GNEWSANHS Western Isles prescribing
OL,4,Aweight loss drugs at triple the rate of
OL,5,Aother health boards
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe biggest variation was seen in
OL,8,Faccess to GLP-1 medication, which is
OL,9,Fwidely used to treat type 2 diabetes
OL,10,Fbut was approved for weight management
OL,11,Fin 2023.
OL,13,FNHS Western Isles said it was seeing
OL,14,F"significant clinical benefit".
